---

<BaseLayout
  title="Home Theater Installation Bulverde TX | KZ Audio & Video"
  description="Custom home theater and AV installation in Bulverde TX. New construction pre-wire, dedicated theaters, and whole-house audio, since 1999. Call (210) 981-4098."
  schema={[schema, breadcrumb]}
>
  <HeroSection
    heading="Home Theater Installation Bulverde TX"
    subhead="KZ Audio & Video installs custom home theaters, whole-house audio, and outdoor AV systems in Bulverde and across Comal County. Nine active builder relationships. Named team, no subcontractors. In the audio business since 1999."
    imageSrc="/images/projects/monty-theater/home-theater-near-san-antonio-hero.jpg"
    imageAlt="Custom home theater installation in Bulverde Texas near San Antonio with 4K projection and surround sound"
    compact={true}
  />

  <TrustBar />

  <!-- Primary local content section -->
  <section class="section bg-charcoal">
    <div class="container-main">
      <p class="overline mb-3 reveal">Serving Bulverde, TX</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-h2 text-warm-white mb-8 reveal reveal-delay-1">
        Bulverde Is One of the Fastest-Growing Custom Home Markets in Texas
      </h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 mb-12">
        <div>
          <p class="text-body-lg text-stone mb-6 reveal reveal-delay-2">
            Bulverde sits along the US-281 and Highway 46 corridors in Comal County, north of San Antonio. It is growing fast: tech workers and professionals relocating from Austin, families from the Medical Center and Stone Oak corridors moving north for land, custom builders putting up some of the most ambitious residential projects in the greater San Antonio region. The homes coming out of this market are large, well-designed, and increasingly built with entertainment in mind.
          </p>
          <p class="text-body-lg text-stone mb-6 reveal reveal-delay-2">Bulverde and the Spring Branch corridor are home to some of the Hill Country's most impressive custom builds. We pre-wire new construction and handle retrofits in existing homes throughout the area.</p>
          <p class="text-body text-stone mb-6 reveal reveal-delay-2">
            New construction is the defining feature of the Bulverde market right now. We have active builder relationships throughout the Spring Branch corridor and into Comal County, which means we are often on the ground in these neighborhoods during framing, before the walls close, before the wiring is set. Pre-wire for home theater, whole-house audio, outdoor AV, and structured low-voltage is dramatically more cost-effective during rough-in than after a home is finished. If your Bulverde home is under construction, we need to talk before drywall goes up.
          </p>
          <p class="text-body text-stone reveal reveal-delay-3">
            For homeowners already in finished Bulverde homes, the picture is different but the opportunity is the same. The large floor plans, dedicated bonus rooms, and expansive outdoor living spaces: pools, fire pits, covered patios with views, common to acreage properties in this area support serious AV installations. The Canyon Lake area is thirty minutes away. Natural Bridge Caverns is nearby. Bulverde homeowners are active, outdoors-oriented, and entertaining at home. A well-built theater and outdoor audio setup fits naturally into how these properties are used.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-6">
          <div class="reveal reveal-delay-2">
            <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold text-warm-white mb-2">Nine Active Builder Relationships</h3>
            <p class="text-body-sm text-stone">We have nine active builder relationships in the greater San Antonio area, including in the Bulverde and Spring Branch market. We coordinate pre-wire directly with builders and GCs: no schedule conflicts, no rework, clean integration into the construction timeline.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="reveal reveal-delay-3">
            <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold text-warm-white mb-2">Named Team, No Subcontractors</h3>
            <p class="text-body-sm text-stone">Kelly, Billy, and Julian do the work. Every Bulverde project is handled by this crew, no subcontractors, no day-labor installers. The people who designed your system install it and service it if anything needs attention later.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="reveal reveal-delay-4">
            <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold text-warm-white mb-2">In the Audio Business Since 1999</h3>
            <p class="text-body-sm text-stone">Kelly has been in audio since 1999. We have worked in enough north Bexar and Comal County rooms to know where the acoustics get difficult and what it takes to make a large great room or a purpose-built media room perform at its best.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="reveal reveal-delay-4">
            <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold text-warm-white mb-2">Free Consultation in Bulverde</h3>
            <p class="text-body-sm text-stone">We drive to Bulverde. Walk the room with you. Give you a straight answer on what is possible at your budget. No charge, no obligation.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Services section with Bulverde angle -->
  <section class="section bg-slate-surface">
    <div class="container-main">
      <p class="overline mb-3 reveal">What We Install in Bulverde</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-h2 text-warm-white mb-4 reveal reveal-delay-1">
        AV Systems Built for Bulverde Properties
      </h2>
      <p class="text-body-lg text-stone mb-12 max-w-3xl reveal reveal-delay-2">
        Large lots, new construction, and outdoor living spaces define this market. Here is what we install for Bulverde homeowners.
      </p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold text-warm-white mb-3">New Construction Pre-Wire</h3>
          <p class="text-body-sm text-stone">
            Bulverde is a new construction market. The most cost-effective time to plan your AV infrastructure is during framing, before insulation and drywall. Pre-wire covers speaker wire for every room and the patio, HDMI and coax runs to displays, structured low-voltage for networking and security cameras, and conduit for future equipment. We coordinate with your builder and GC as part of the construction schedule. Homeowners who skip pre-wire pay significantly more in retrofit labor later.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold text-warm-white mb-3">Dedicated Home Theaters</h3>
          <p class="text-body-sm text-stone">
            Custom homes in the Bulverde area frequently include dedicated media rooms, pre-framed during construction or converted from bonus space. We design and install the full theater: 4K projection or large-format display, in-wall or in-ceiling speaker systems with Dolby Atmos height channels, acoustic treatment, custom seating platforms, LED accent lighting, and clean equipment racks. A dedicated room performs at a level a great room conversion cannot match, and Bulverde floor plans regularly have the space to do it properly.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal reveal-delay-3">
          <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold text-warm-white mb-3">Outdoor AV for Acreage Properties</h3>
          <p class="text-body-sm text-stone">
            Bulverde properties on acreage: with pools, fire pit areas, large covered patios, and Hill Country views, call for outdoor AV that matches the setting. We install weatherproof speakers rated for Texas summers, commercial-grade displays engineered for ambient light conditions, and landscape speaker systems that cover large outdoor zones. Everything is spec'd for outdoor use, no consumer electronics installed in an outdoor environment, no equipment that fails after one season.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold text-warm-white mb-3">Whole-House Audio</h3>
          <p class="text-body-sm text-stone">
            Multi-room audio is one of the most common projects we do in new construction markets. Every room: master bedroom, kitchen, living areas, office, patio, plays the music you want from your phone without separate remotes or complicated switching. Sonos and Russound platforms handle both new construction installs and retrofits. If your Bulverde home was pre-wired for speakers but the system was never installed, we can finish the job.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold text-warm-white mb-3">Home Networking for Large Properties</h3>
          <p class="text-body-sm text-stone">
            Consumer routers fail on large Bulverde properties. Acreage homes, long driveways, detached garages, and guest casitas all need reliable Wi-Fi coverage that a single router cannot provide. We install enterprise-grade access point systems: Ubiquiti and similar platforms, with structured CAT6 runs to every access point. Solid networking is the foundation that home theater, whole-house audio, security cameras, and smart home systems all depend on.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal reveal-delay-3">
          <h3 class="font-sans font-semibold text-warm-white mb-3">Security Camera Systems</h3>
          <p class="text-body-sm text-stone">
            Large lots and long driveways common in the Bulverde area benefit from perimeter security camera coverage. We install commercial-grade NVR-based systems with fixed and PTZ cameras, local recording, and remote viewing from your phone. Cameras run on the same structured wiring infrastructure as your AV system, fewer wall penetrations, cleaner install. We have been doing this work in Comal County long enough to know where cameras need to go on these property types.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Builder partnerships and pre-wire focus section -->
  <section class="section bg-charcoal">
    <div class="container-main max-w-3xl">
      <p class="overline mb-3 reveal">Builder Partnerships</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-h2 text-warm-white mb-6 reveal reveal-delay-1">
        Why Bulverde Builders Work with KZ Audio & Video
      </h2>
      <p class="text-body-lg text-stone mb-6 reveal reveal-delay-2">
        We have nine active builder relationships in the greater San Antonio market, including in the Bulverde and Spring Branch corridor. Those relationships exist because we do not create problems on job sites. We show up on schedule during the pre-wire phase, run clean wire, label everything, and hand off documentation that the finish crew and the homeowner can actually use. We do not require the GC to babysit us or redo our work.
      </p>
      <p class="text-body text-stone mb-6 reveal reveal-delay-2">
        For homeowners working with a custom builder in Bulverde: introduce us early. The conversation about what AV systems you want belongs at the design phase, not after move-in. The cost difference between pre-wiring a theater, whole-house audio, outdoor speakers, and security cameras during construction versus retrofitting them later is substantial: typically $3,000 to $8,000 in additional labor for a project that was perfectly doable at $1,200 during rough-in.
      </p>
      <p class="text-body text-stone reveal reveal-delay-3">
        The Bulverde market is attracting buyers who have lived in well-appointed homes in Austin or other markets and know what a properly built AV system looks and sounds like. They are not interested in an installer who shows up with surface-run conduit and a bag of zip ties. Neither are we interested in building systems that way. The builder relationships we have are with custom builders whose clients expect quality, and that is who we build for.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <ProjectsGrid projects={projects} overline="Recent Work" heading="Home Theater Projects Near Bulverde" />

  <TestimonialsSection featured={featured} />

  <FAQAccordion heading="Home Theater Installation Bulverde TX: FAQ" faqs={faqs} />

  <CTASection
    heading="Free In-Home Consultation: Bulverde TX"
    body="We come to you. Walk the space. Tell you exactly what is possible at your budget. No charge, no obligation."
    ctaLabel="Book Your Free Consultation"
    ctaHref="/contact-kz-audio-video-san-antonio-tx/"
    secondaryLabel="Call (210) 981-4098"
    secondaryHref="tel:2109814098"
  />
</BaseLayout>
